<mjml>
  <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF" width="660px">
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding-top="12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Tere,&nbsp;*|FNAME|*</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Kirjale on lisatud sinu allkirjastatud avaldus, millega lõpetad oma III&nbsp;samba
          kindlustuslepingu ja kannad selle raha Tuleva III&nbsp;Samba Pensionifondi.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Avaldus jõuab kindlustusandjani siis, kui sa selle ise edasi saadad. Saada see kiri koos
          manusega edasi kindlustusandjale (*|insurerName|*) aadressil
          <a href="mailto:*|insurerEmail|*">*|insurerEmail|*</a>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Kui kindlustusandja küsib sinult veel midagi, vasta talle otse.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="./partials/contact_et.mjml" />
    <mj-section padding="0 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding-top="12px">Tuleva</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/disclaimer_pension_et.mjml" />
    <mj-include path="./partials/footer_bottom_fund.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
